	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Ace
	"...그게..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"중앙 컴퓨터실\n방어를 도와줬으면\n했는데."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"만일을 위해서 말이야..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = HarpNote
