	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"날 걱정할 필요\n없어, 미소라!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"구달 박사님과 곤타, 키자마로를\n안전하게 지켜 주는 게\n더 좋을 거야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = HarpNote
